(POLICY CONTRACT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This Policy Contract is a legal agreement between AIA and the Policy Owner. It sets out the) Tj
T*
(terms, conditions, benefits, and exclusions applicable to AIA Secure Guard Term. Please read) Tj
T*
(this contract carefully together with the Product Summary and any endorsements issued.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(DEFINITIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
('Life Assured' means the person whose life is insured under this Policy. 'Policy Owner') Tj
T*
(means the person who owns this Policy and is entitled to exercise all rights under it. 'Sum) Tj
T*
(Assured' means the amount stated in the Policy Schedule payable upon a valid claim. 'Total) Tj
T*
(and Permanent Disability' means the Life Assured is, as a result of accident or illness,) Tj
T*
(permanently unable to perform at least three of the six Activities of Daily Living, or is) Tj
T*
(permanently unable to engage in any occupation for which they are reasonably suited by) Tj
T*
(training, education or experience.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 1 - DEATH BENEFIT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Upon receipt of due proof that the Life Assured has died while this Policy is in force, AIA) Tj
T*
(will pay the Sum Assured, less any outstanding premiums or indebtedness, to the beneficiary) Tj
T*
(nominated under this Policy. Claims must be submitted with a certified death certificate and) Tj
T*
(a completed claim form within 90 days of death.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 2 - TOTAL AND PERMANENT DISABILITY BENEFIT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If the Life Assured becomes Totally and Permanently Disabled before the Policy Anniversary) Tj
T*
(on which the Life Assured's age is 65, AIA will pay the Sum Assured in full and final) Tj
T*
(settlement of this benefit and all cover under this Policy will terminate.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 3 - EXCLUSIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(No benefit is payable if death or Total and Permanent Disability results directly or) Tj
T*
(indirectly from: \(a\) suicide or attempted suicide within 12 months of the Policy Issue Date) Tj
T*
(or reinstatement date, whichever is later; \(b\) war, invasion, or act of a foreign enemy,) Tj
T*
(whether declared or not; \(c\) participation in a criminal act; or \(d\) pre-existing conditions) Tj
T*
(not disclosed at application that AIA would not have accepted on the terms offered had they) Tj
T*
(been disclosed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 4 - PREMIUM PAYMENT AND GRACE PERIOD) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Premiums are payable in advance on each Premium Due Date. A grace period of 31 days is) Tj
T*
(allowed for payment of each premium after the first. If premium remains unpaid at the end of) Tj
T*
(the grace period, the Policy will lapse and all cover will cease.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 5 - REINSTATEMENT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A lapsed Policy may be reinstated within 2 years of the date of lapse, subject to) Tj
T*
(satisfactory evidence of insurability and payment of all overdue premiums with interest at) Tj
ET
